  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NDM - Immediate Response Loan La Soufriere Volcano - St. Vincent And The Grenadines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(a) the repair, replacement or the installation of measures to protect and restore vital economic infrastructure (power, water, roads, housing and other communication infrastructure) necessary for the resumption of social and economic activities; 
(b) consultancy services to perform technical inspections and certify expenditure for goods, works and services for cleaning and clearing activities.
(c) early-stage recovery activities including supporting consultancy services for the delivery of specialist technical expertise and/or augmenting assistance being provided by other partner development institutions; 
(d) enhanced coordination of intersectoral MHPSS through a human rights framework and assessments of mental health and psychosocial issues with participatory systems for monitoring and evaluation of support services; and
(e) consultancy services to prepare designs for high priority critical projects for the longer term rehabilitation phase.</narrative>
  </description>
